<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-E JULY GROUP NET FALLS TO PLN 3.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-E JULY GROUP NET FALLS TO PLN 3.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary group results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.56 vs   4.46</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.98 vs   5.28</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.84 vs   2.86</p>
<p> Sales		   60.04 vs  48.57</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    43.73 vs  25.28</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	48.20 vs  28.42</p>
<p> Operating profit    20.09 vs  12.23</p>
<p> Sales		  330.17 vs 252.66</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish trading and construction firm is</p>
<p>Mostostal Export SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
